# KiCad library 3D models that tools/samples boards name, fetched from KiCad's own repo rather than
# shipped here (agni issue 1652). KiCad's library is CC-BY-SA 4.0 with an exception for designs, so
# this repo carries only where to get each file. `make samples-oracle` runs
#   hack/fetch_remote.sh hack/kicad_models.pin tools/samples/kicad-models
# and each file lands in tools/samples/kicad-models/<Library>.3dshapes/, the layout --model-path reads.
# The commit is KiCad's 10.0.6 tag, whose files hash the same as KiCad 10.0.6's installed library,
# which wrote core/render/testdata/*.kicad3d.tsv.
#
# <sha256>  <library folder>  <url at a fixed commit>
